# proto-file: protowire/schema/config/v1/config.proto
# proto-message: protowire.schema.config.v1.EngineConfig
#
# Golden engine configuration (RFC-001 §9.4): the content of a project's
# `protowire.config.textproto`. Configures the engine the §5.3 worked
# example would run under. Exercises every EngineConfig field except
# `engine`, which is RESERVED since 2026-09-07 (RFC-001 §9.4, issue
# #282): the expression language is fixed by §5.4, so nothing selects
# one; validators MUST ignore the field and tooling SHOULD warn when it
# is set. Loader conformance: discovery walks upward to the NEAREST
# config (no merging); per-setting CLI flags > --config >
# PROTOWIRE_CONFIG > discovered file > defaults (lenient, collect-all).

function_libraries: "myco/commons/validator.proto"
function_libraries: "myco/commons/types.proto"
catalog_libraries: "myco/i18n/en.textproto"
catalog_libraries: "myco/i18n/de.textproto"
strict_validation: true
default_mode: EXECUTION_MODE_COLLECT_ALL
max_recursion_depth: 64
